  "body": "**Experience holiday living every day, surrounded by nature and breathtaking ocean views at Hobbs Bay.**\r\n\r\nThis architecturally designed home offers three spacious bedrooms, including a private master wing with a generous ensuite and sweeping west-facing views, plus a dedicated study. Two additional bedrooms are tucked away with a shared bathroom for added privacy. A separate media room and open-plan living and dining area open seamlessly to expansive northwest-facing decks - perfect for entertaining with stunning coastal outlooks.\r\n\r\nMove Once — That’s It! With Signature’s turnkey opportunity, enjoy a simple, stress-free way to build by the beach. Pay a 10% deposit upfront, with the balance due on completion — no progress payments required. Just relax and watch your new home come to life. As a bonus, the Watercare Infrastructure Growth Charge (valued at over $25,000) is included, with connections already secured - an increasingly rare benefit as new Watercare allocations are now limited. Get in touch with the Signature Homes team today to secure this opportunity and start living your dream coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nNestled at the tip of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, Hobbs Bay Estate is a premium waterfront subdivision by the renowned Hopper Developments. This exceptional coastal community offers panoramic ocean views, beautifully maintained green spaces, dedicated walkways, direct beach access with no section more than a three-minute walk from the shoreline, as well as a children’s playground and historic homestead. With the Gulf Harbour ferry providing easy CBD access and the upcoming Penlink motorway, you can enjoy the convenience of nearby amenities while embracing a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\n**Key Features:**\r\n- Prime corner section with a view shaft that captures ocean views \r\n- Vertical Cedar and Resene Integra Lightweight Concrete Fascade Cladding\r\n- Three spacious bedrooms, including a private master wing with ensuite and west-facing views\r\n- Dedicated study for added flexibility\r\n- Two additional bedrooms with a shared bathroom, tucked away for privacy\r\n- Separate media room for extra living space\r\n- Open-plan living and dining flow to expansive northwest-facing decks\r\n- Fireplace in the living room",
